{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_title", "source_sha256": "385d5fb83bcc801977088b7059c95d6d2da76fb339aaa5e4c37b4537fa2e29df", "ja": "天使たちの祭典", "zh": "天使们的祭典", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "5465784c0bcde4d9c0fc59c5b0eca75878c741751a6a0f3bdf8b95d67fee9779", "ja": "Angelチームの公演で、チームの代表と\nしてオープニングナンバーを任されることに\nなった5人。翼の提案で、お披露目公演に向\nけて、カラオケでキックオフミーティングを\nすることに。", "zh": "五人被选为分队的代表，\n将在Angel队公演负责开场演出。\n在翼的建议下，\n她们决定来到卡拉OK，\n为首次亮相公演召开启动会议。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6679fd24792869700b9fd19bc01dd917ee1a2c6dcad8600e426d025a9824c5e9", "ja": "（早速『ANGEL STARS』のメンバーを集め、\nオープニングナンバーになる新曲を聞いてもらった）", "zh": "（我赶紧召集了『ANGEL STARS』的成员，\n让她们听听被选为开场曲目的新歌。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_1001_016tsu", "source_sha256": "427523b34bfc591c3d1146bb13c29a9e3ff62cf4e1e9eff0372e073f75b6e777", "ja": "わぁ、カワイイ曲～！\nダンスは、こんなカンジがいいな～♪", "zh": "哇，好可爱的歌～！\n那舞步要这种感觉比较好吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_1002_052kao", "source_sha256": "5908620a8f11e33bbc2299a57f710d2a2c5e56db5e4e4c3f0d3b95254f40007c", "ja": "まあ……！　翼ちゃん、もうダンスのこと考えてるの？", "zh": "哇……！小翼已经开始想舞步了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_1003_016tsu", "source_sha256": "b28ab1f5587c15624c4910e2cfab1452b22024c34b0b32991db2a8edd1ad69d4", "ja": "うん♪　ダンスもカワイイといいな～って。\nそれで、サビは……こんなカンジとか！", "zh": "嗯♪我觉得舞步也要可爱一点的比较好～\n至于副歌时……就像这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_1004_052kao", "source_sha256": "f7aff86107840852adbb339f34137711b56c21583f0ce65e0ae447fc72201bea", "ja": "ふふっ、そのダンスに合わせるなら、\nどんな歌い方がいいかしら？　ララララ～……♪", "zh": "呵呵，如果要配合那个舞步，\n该用什么唱法比较好呢？啦啦啦啦……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_1005_p", "source_sha256": "491f01348ccb2a4ae25fb9dc6374fde7846fb5d8cd85ed40a1a7211ab90336ae", "ja": "気に入ってもらえたみたいでよかった。\nどうだろうみんな、やれそうかな？", "zh": "看来大家都喜欢，真是太好了。\n怎么样？感觉练得起来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_1006_022ser", "source_sha256": "6f49ba2d4320a4f945ead3f86619581760d992c15155a878b86ea73687f6306d", "ja": "はいっ。早く、お客さんの前で歌いたいです！\nみなさん、喜んでくれるでしょうか？", "zh": "是的，好想赶快在观众面前唱！\n不晓得大家听了会不会开心呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_1007_048rei", "source_sha256": "a98a91905386f98b18318ca13d0f183066b8ee16ffecc6c91dc8570e0cae0ae2", "ja": "うん！　きっと、みんな喜んでくれると思うな♪\nそれからそれから♪", "zh": "嗯！我想大家一定会很开心的♪\n然后然后♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "6b5d260f3f0ec8a7f63d4e804ab8b108d5efbc3abb9ebb3c30f1f74775b4b8ba", "ja": "お客さんも一緒にステージに立てたら、\nもっと楽しくて、喜んでもらえちゃうかも？", "zh": "要是观众们也一起站上舞台，\n说不定会更欢乐、更开心喔？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "bd92451b22922c5aa440cfad0eb3447659b9df76efb98d48d720819a35cbe2fc", "ja": "うん。そこはちゃんと、\nアイドルだけで勝負しような！", "zh": "嗯，这部分我们还是单纯靠\n偶像的表演来决胜负吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_1010_p", "source_sha256": "95545eba0af19e08fc7e631690fc7374f778e95955806febb3238ad5e3e874aa", "ja": "さて、この後はレッスンの予定を組んである。\n早速だけど、しっかり頼むぞ！", "zh": "好了，接下来有安排训练课程，\n虽然有点赶，但大家可要好好加油！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "3e3dcaf9e9703857ff6ee78085fc8e110444b19453ba57be41d2a908e58d6ce9", "ja": "みんなに……喜んでもらう、ライブ……\n杏奈に、できる……かな……？", "zh": "让大家……开心的演唱会……\n杏奈……做得到吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "f94ca1bdaf95912f464f160fab6950fdf8e7c3d432197f2ffdc387a2251dc581", "ja": "大丈夫！　みんなでいっぱいレッスンすれば、\n絶対にできるよ♪　杏奈ちゃん、一緒に頑張ろう！", "zh": "没问题！只要大家一起努力训练，\n绝对做得到的♪小杏奈，一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_1013_022ser", "source_sha256": "a5ac8cef219fd3229e702edfb9f4543e1dfaa63cbae913cbb77763e7a2e2205c", "ja": "杏奈ちゃん、わたしも頑張ります！\nみんなで一緒に頑張りましょうね！", "zh": "小杏，我也会加油！\n大家一起加油吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "15b60719626989904abd5b2833f603c28ad5966f93f783ebc7380b0047aecc44", "ja": "麗花さん……星梨花ちゃん……。\nうん……杏奈、精一杯……頑張る、よ……！", "zh": "丽花姊……星梨花……\n嗯……杏奈会……拚命加油的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_1015_016tsu", "source_sha256": "4dd2a25ba764e9b2b5aecd38a92b1632b4c60eaa565437557e6e31848f2cc53e", "ja": "{$P$}さん、衣装はどんなのですか？\nわたし、カワイイのがいいな～！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，服装是什么风格呢？\n我想穿可爱一点的～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_1016_052kao", "source_sha256": "ccea7097c8cd6b3e7b6ad37dd45d85965ec6d8abf93ae6aeae0d0dbb47dc18ff", "ja": "Fairy公演の衣装や舞台演出も、\nとっても素敵でしたね♪", "zh": "Fairy公演的服装和舞台演出\n都很棒呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_1017_016tsu", "source_sha256": "345494026fcc178155c9ee162906c072ab29271e8b3ed8adec55d104a22b4a8b", "ja": "え～、Fairyのみんなに負けたくないな～。\nう～ん……。", "zh": "咦～真不想输给Fairy的成员～\n唔～嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_1018_016tsu", "source_sha256": "f42cc3c68a33dfcae0c7fb57875e7e7684a6f371440042fb77a521c568e84777", "ja": "そうだ！　今からショッピングに行って、\nみんなで衣装を選びませんか？", "zh": "对了！我们现在去逛街，\n大家一起选表演服装好不好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_1019", "source_sha256": "e91c49be323e9b861ef41de2600398ad04a4378b1c60e2cf2c6db8e6ed681794", "ja": "選びません", "zh": "不好", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_2000_p", "source_sha256": "a8d53adb34053d537956297c1184500c7b25c7dec2368bfbf0b8dcf1f15f561a", "ja": "翼、この後はレッスンの予定だって言っただろ？\n衣装も演出も大事だけど、まずは基礎を固めないと。", "zh": "翼，我说过接下来有安排训练课程吧？\n虽然服装和演出都很重要，但要先打好基础才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_2001_p", "source_sha256": "cc1cfadcfaec4502553e482a056facf4dd35ed2087eb9ab4240cf59b074764e0", "ja": "Angelチームの代表に選ばれたんだから、\nみんなには責任感を持ってもらわないとな！", "zh": "既然被选为Angel队的代表了，\n希望大家能多点责任感！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_2002_024ann", "source_sha256": "5add3f342dde406c4feca273ca5967a66c841d0a08c68f5c0775ae3213a021fe", "ja": "チームの……代表……\n杏奈……も……。", "zh": "分队的……代表……\n杏奈……也是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_2003_052kao", "source_sha256": "9a7a42057e4bbc7668868cd0f260fac083489101a0b8553cedbd9e49e0839060", "ja": "そうよ、杏奈ちゃん。公演までは、まだ時間があるし\n……みんなで、しっかり学んでいきましょう。ね？", "zh": "对呀，杏奈，现在离公演还有一段时间……\n大家一起认真学习吧，好不好？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_2004_024ann", "source_sha256": "47abde67a7522ce9e5f154c35329b6f9fb951cc4490e290f6c907bafd447f7be", "ja": "う、うん……。\nありがとう……歌織、さん……♪", "zh": "嗯、嗯……\n谢谢你……歌织姊……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_2005_016tsu", "source_sha256": "20e8abeddb5bc2152494e2e82cb802e5c0b45818330180020d76742a3fd066fd", "ja": "あ、それじゃショッピングじゃなくて～。\nみんなでカラオケに行きませんか？", "zh": "啊，那就别去逛街～\n大家一起去卡拉OK呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_2006_016tsu", "source_sha256": "1a3caaa63f3be9a2bd246b3b8f51d520ef5ecd55b67cbaf2f48796b10ef347c8", "ja": "カラオケだったら、歌の練習にもなりますよねっ。\nあとは～……。", "zh": "去卡拉OK的话也能练习唱歌嘛。\n还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_2007_016tsu", "source_sha256": "43c216a4683d521ef8d3ad959106c25fb0a6fc83e268f708d4fb48e35a9b82c9", "ja": "みんなでい～っぱい遊んで、仲良くなって、\nこれからレッスン頑張りましょー♪　みたいな？", "zh": "大家一起大～玩一场，加深感情，\n之后一起努力训练──♪这样如何？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_2008_p", "source_sha256": "9e86e1c18a8c8ade52b699df740a2c1cafd1f160f28ee614d3ccabd705437a63", "ja": "キックオフミーティングってことか？\nそれならまぁ、ありかもしれないが……。", "zh": "是召开启动会议的意思吗？\n这样的话还比较能接受……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_2009_048rei", "source_sha256": "8e2cf88300bd572dd41690cdb52e00c93ef54aa3a714bc6fc8b4f7b8756ee1cc", "ja": "わぁ、いいですね！　ANGEL STARSカラオケ大会♪\n優勝商品は……じゃじゃーん！　ナイショです♪", "zh": "哇，好棒喔！『ANGEL STARS』卡拉OK大赛♪\n冠军奖品是……锵锵──！秘密♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_2010_024ann", "source_sha256": "1be6bd4136251f057f906afe4185556e62938a4be5a4811e732526075ecd0d6d", "ja": "内緒……なの？", "zh": "是秘密……吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_2011_022ser", "source_sha256": "35d5370651e8a337b4a8514cb7511c4cfcd9a6036dfe6f9d47dfacccc26e2f3f", "ja": "カラオケですか？　聞いたことはあるんですけど、\nわたし、行ったことがなくて……。", "zh": "卡拉OK吗？虽然有听过，\n但我从来没去过……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_2012_p", "source_sha256": "8539f914cb2f3f1eff4f271fcd71691235209c0e0021c11405e6e089c19ca998", "ja": "星梨花、カラオケに行ったことがないのか……！？", "zh": "星梨花，你没去过卡拉OK吗……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_2013_022ser", "source_sha256": "edd489f34dbc15de703d7fc36cebffcd00bfa731a4a02fe310d2b0997bd362a4", "ja": "はい！　なんだか、楽しそうなところなんですね。\n{$P$}さん、行ってみたいです！", "zh": "是的！感觉是个很欢乐的地方呢，\n{$P$}先生，我想去看看！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0014_story_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0014_story_01_2014_016tsu", "source_sha256": "5f8e903894bde177e20d433670d782ef2807422124970701561609ce06d3e048", "ja": "ねえ{$P$}さん、行きましょうよ～。\n……ダメぇ？", "zh": "好嘛，{$P$}先生，让我们去嘛～\n……不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
